\fs22
 \b I. NGHIEP VU HE THONG KHACH SAN\b0\par
\par
\b 1. Muc tieu he thong\b0\par
He thong Hotel Service duoc xay dung de quan ly mot khach san theo nghiep vu co ban den nang cao: quan ly tai khoan nguoi dung, phan quyen, quan ly phong, quan ly loai phong, quan ly tang, quan ly dat phong, thanh toan, va cap nhat trang thai van hanh.\par
\par
\b 2. Vai tro nghiep vu\b0\par
- \b ADMIN\b0: quan tri toan bo he thong, tao/sua/xoa user, tao/sua/xoa room, quan ly trang thai, quan ly reservation va report.\par
- \b STAFF\b0: van hanh nghiep vu hang ngay, xem danh sach, cap nhat phong, xac nhan yeu cau, check-in/check-out, ho tro khach.\par
- \b GUEST\b0: dang ky tai khoan, dang nhap, cap nhat ho so ca nhan, xem phong trong, tao don dat phong, xem lich su cua minh.\par
\par
\b 3. Luong nghiep vu chuan cua he thong\b0\par
- Khach dang ky tai khoan.\par
- He thong tu gan role GUEST mac dinh.\par
- ADMIN/STAFF dang nhap va quan ly phong, loai phong, tang.\par
- GUEST xem danh sach phong, phong trong, va tao reservation.\par
- STAFF xac nhan don, check-in, check-out, ho tro khach.\par
- He thong luu lich su tinh trang phong, thanh toan va charge phat sinh.\par
\par
\b 4. Mo hinh nghiep vu hien tai da phu hop\b0\par
- \b User - Role\b0: dung bang trung gian user_roles la dung huong vi 1 user co the co nhieu role.\par
- \b Hotel - Floor - RoomType - Room\b0: phan tang nghiep vu ro rang, de mo rong.\par
- \b RoomImage/RoomTypeImage/HotelImage\b0: tach anh theo doi tuong, hop ly va de quan ly gallery.\par
- \b Reservation/ReservationItem/Payment/Charge\b0: co du khung de xu ly booking thuc te.\par
\par
\b 5. Danh gia nghiep vu hien tai\b0\par
- Huong thiet ke co ban la dung cho website quan ly khach san.\par
- Da co tieu chuan phan quyen ADMIN/STAFF/GUEST ro rang.\par
- Room domain da co du thong tin de hoat dong co ban: hotel, floor, room type, status, note, images.\par
- Reservation da co thong tin co ban de dat phong theo ngay va so dem.\par
- Tuy nhien, can thong nhat 1 model dat phong chinh va bo model lech nghiep vu nhu Booking cu.\par
\par
