\b 8. `src/main/java/org/example/hotel_service/entities/User.java` va `Role.java`\b0\par
- `User`: luu username, email, password hash, status, last login, timestamps, profile va set userRoles.\par
- `Role`: luu ten role theo enum `Roles`, mo ta, timestamps, va set userRoles.\par
- `Set<UserRole>` la dung nghiep vu hon `List`, vi mot user co the co nhieu role va can tranh trung lap.\par
\par
\b 9. `src/main/java/org/example/hotel_service/entities/Room.java`, `Hotel.java`, `Floor.java`, `RoomType.java`\b0\par
- `Hotel`: la cap tong quan cua resort/khach san, co danh sach floor, roomType, room, images.\par
- `Floor`: gom cac room trong cung hotel theo tang.\par
- `RoomType`: dinh nghia hang phong, gia, suc chua, tien nghi, gallery, amenities.\par
- `Room`: la phong vat ly, bat buoc co hotel + roomType, co floor va status.\par
\par
\b 10. Nhan xet ve do ro rang cua code\b0\par
- O auth/user, code da kha ro va co the mo rong.\par
- O room, service da goi duoc nghiep vu co ban.\par
- O reservation/booking, can thong nhat chuan ten va lifecycle de tranh trung lap.\par
