\b 3. Huong phat trien kien truc\b0\par
- Chot 1 source schema duy nhat: Flyway migration.\par
- Bo `Booking` neu khong can, chi dung `Reservation/ReservationItem`.\par
- Tach service layer theo module: auth, user, room, reservation, payment.\par
- Bo sung test integration cho RBAC va ownership.\par
- Bo sung swagger/OpenAPI de de ban giao cho frontend.\par
- Dua secret ra environment variables.\par
\par
\b 4. Danh sach cong viec de hoan thien he thong\b0\par
1. Dong bo va don dep model reservation.\par
2. Viet reservation service + controller.\par
3. Viet payment service + webhook.\par
4. Bo sung floor/hotel/room-type CRUD.\par
5. Viet test cho role ADMIN/STAFF/GUEST.\par
6. Hoan thien migration va seed data.\par
7. Toi uu query va them audit log.\par
\par
\b 5. Ket luan\b0\par
He thong da co nen tang dung cho mot website quan ly khach san. Phan user, auth, role, va room da kha on. Buoc tiep theo quan trong nhat la hoan thien reservation lifecycle, thanh toan, va dong bo schema de he thong san sang dua vao su dung that.\par
